ion of the Discs of Norgannon to the Explorers' League in Ironforge.",dungeon="Uldaman"},[2280]={id=2280,title="The Platinum Discs",level=47,minLevel=40,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2278},nextQuest=2440,starts={{kind="object",id=131474,name="The Discs of Norgannon"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3978,name="Sage Truthseeker",spots={{map=1456,x=0.344,y=0.4687}}}},text="Take the miniature version of the Discs of Norgannon to the one of the sages in Thunder Bluff.",dungeon="Uldaman"},[2281]={id=2281,title="Redridge Rendezvous",level=16,minLevel=16,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",nextQuest=2282,starts={{kind="npc",id=6946,name="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",spots={{map=1453,x=0.7829,y=0.7114}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6966,name="Lucius",spots={{map=1433,x=0.2297,y=0.5204}}}},text="Venture forth to Lakeshire in the Redridge Mountains and speak with Lucius.\n",flags=8},[2282]={id=2282,title="Alther's Mill",level=20,minLevel=16,map=1433,zone="Redridge Mountains",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={2281},starts={{kind="npc",id=6966,name="Lucius",spots={{map=1433,x=0.2297,y=0.5204}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6966,name="Lucius",spots={{map=1433,x=0.2297,y=0.5204}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=7871,name="Token of Thievery",count=0,spots={{map=1433,x=0.4695,y=0.4469}}}},text="Open Lucius's Lockbox, recover the Token of Thievery and return it to Lucius in Lakeshire."},[2283]={id=2283,title="Necklace Recovery",level=41,minLevel=37,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",nextQuest=2284,starts={{kind="npc",id=6986,name="Dran Droffers",spots={{map=1454,x=0.5949,y=0.3657}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6986,name="Dran Droffers",spots={{map=1454,x=0.5949,y=0.3657}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=7666,name="Shattered Necklace",count=0,spots={{map=1418,x=0.438,y=0.106},{map=1418,x=0.444,y=0.124},{map=1418,x=0.438,y=0.108}}}},text="Look for a valuable necklace within the Uldaman dig site and bring it back to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar. The necklace may be damaged.",dungeon="Uldaman",flags=8},[2284]={id=2284,title="Necklace Recovery, Take 2",level=41,minLevel=37,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2283},nextQuest=2318,starts={{kind="npc",id=6986,name="Dran Droffers",spots={{map=1454,x=0.5949,y=0.3657}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6912,name="Remains of a Paladin"}},text="Find a clue as to the gems' whereabouts in the depths of Uldaman.",dungeon="Uldaman",flags=8},[2298]={id=2298,title="Kingly Shakedown",level=16,minLevel=16,map=1455,zone="Ironforge",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",untilCompleted=2281,starts={{kind="npc",id=5165,name="Hulfdan Blackbeard",spots={{map=1455,x=0.5196,y=0.1484}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6946,name="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",spots={{map=1453,x=0.7829,y=0.7114}}}},text="Travel to Stormwind and seek out Renzik \"The Shiv.\"",flags=8},[2299]={id=2299,title="To Hulfdan!",level=16,minLevel=16,map=1455,zone="Ironforge",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",untilCompleted=2281,nextQuest=2298,starts={{kind="npc",id=1234,name="Hogral Bakkan"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=5165,name="Hulfdan Blackbeard",spots={{map=1455,x=0.5196,y=0.1484}}}},text="Travel to Ironforge and speak with Hulfdan Blackbeard.",flags=8},[2300]={id=2300,title="SI:7",level=16,minLevel=16,map=1429,zone="Elwynn Forest",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",untilCompleted=2281,nextQuest=2281,starts={{kind="npc",id=917,name="Keryn Sylvius",spots={{map=1429,x=0.4387,y=0.6594}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6946,name="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",spots={{map=1453,x=0.7829,y=0.7114}}}},text="Travel to Stormwind and seek out Renzik \"The Shiv.\"\n",flags=8},[2318]={id=2318,title="Translating the Journal",level=42,minLevel=37,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2284},nextQuest=2338,starts={{kind="npc",id=6912,name="Remains of a Paladin"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6868,name="Jarkal Mossmeld",spots={{map=1418,x=0.0242,y=0.4606}}}},text="Find someone who can translate the paladin's journal. The closest location that might have someone is Kargath, in the Badlands."},[2338]={id=2338,title="Translating the Journal",level=42,minLevel=37,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2318},nextQuest=2339,starts={{kind="npc",id=6868,name="Jarkal Mossmeld",spots={{map=1418,x=0.0242,y=0.4606}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6868,name="Jarkal Mossmeld",spots={{map=1418,x=0.0242,y=0.4606}}}},text="Let Jarkal borrow the necklace. In exchange, he will translate the journal for you."},[2339]={id=2339,title="Find the Gems and Power Source",level=44,minLevel=37,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2338},nextQuest=2340,starts={{kind="npc",id=6868,name="Jarkal Mossmeld",spots={{map=1418,x=0.0242,y=0.4606}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6868,name="Jarkal Mossmeld",spots={{map=1418,x=0.0242,y=0.4606}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=7669,name="Shattered Necklace Ruby",count=0},{kind="item",id=7670,name="Shattered Necklace Sapphire",count=0},{kind="item",id=7671,name="Shattered Necklace Topaz",count=0},{kind="item",id=7672,name="Shattered Necklace Power Source",count=0}},text="Recover all three gems and a power source for the necklace from Uldaman, and then bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath. Jarkal believes a power source might be found on the strongest construct present in Uldaman.\n\nFrom the journal, you know...\n* The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area.\n* The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves.\n* The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader.",dungeon="Uldaman"},[2340]={id=2340,title="Deliver the Gems",level=44,minLevel=37,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2339},nextQuest=2341,starts={{kind="npc",id=6868,name="Jarkal Mossmeld",spots={{map=1418,x=0.0242,y=0.4606}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6986,name="Dran Droffers",spots={{map=1454,x=0.5949,y=0.3657}}}},text="Deliver the Necklace and Gem Salvage to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar."},[2341]={id=2341,title="Necklace Recovery, Take 3",level=44,minLevel=40,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2340},starts={{kind="npc",id=6986,name="Dran Droffers",spots={{map=1454,x=0.5949,y=0.3657}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6868,name="Jarkal Mossmeld",spots={{map=1418,x=0.0242,y=0.4606}}}},text="Visit Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath to see if he was successful.",flags=8},[2342]={id=2342,title="Reclaimed Treasures",level=43,minLevel=33,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=5651,name="Patrick Garrett",spots={{map=1458,x=0.6232,y=0.4861}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=5651,name="Patrick Garrett",spots={{map=1458,x=0.6232,y=0.4861}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=8026,name="Garrett Family Treasure",count=0,spots={{map=1418,x=0.3419,y=0.1863}}}},text="Get Patrick Garrett's family treasure from their family chest in the South Common Hall of Uldaman, and bring it to him in the Undercity.",dungeon="Uldaman",flags=8},[2358]={id=2358,title="Horns of Nez'ra",level=22,minLevel=16,map=1433,zone="Redridge Mountains",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",starts={{kind="npc",id=7009,name="Arantir",spots={{map=1433,x=0.2297,y=0.5232}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=7009,name="Arantir",spots={{map=1433,x=0.2297,y=0.5232}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=7906,name="Horns of Nez'ra",count=0,spots={{map=1433,x=0.6452,y=0.5579},{map=1433,x=0.2216,y=0.1642},{map=1433,x=0.6441,y=0.5404}}}},text="Return the Horns of Nez'ra to Arantir's Shadow in Lakeshire.",flags=8},[2359]={id=2359,title="Klaven's Tower",level=24,minLevel=20,map=1436,zone="Westfall",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={2360},nextQuest=2607,starts={{kind="npc",id=7024,name="Agent Kearnen",spots={{map=1436,x=0.6849,y=0.7008}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=332,name="Master Mathias Shaw",spots={{map=1453,x=0.7831,y=0.7074}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=7908,name="Klaven Mortwake's Journal",count=0,spots={{map=1436,x=0.7041,y=0.7393}}},{kind="item",id=7923,name="Defias Tower Key",count=0,spots={{map=1436,x=0.6947,y=0.7399}}}},text="Steal the Defias Tower Key, break into the Defias Tower and uncover the contents of the Duskwood Chest. Take whatever information you find back to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind. Read Kearnen's Journal to gain insight about the tower.\n"},[2360]={id=2360,title="Mathias and the Defias",level=20,minLevel=20,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=8,faction="Alliance",nextQuest=2359,starts={{kind="npc",id=332,name="Master Mathias Shaw",spots={{map=1453,x=0.7831,y=0.7074}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=7024,name="Agent Kearnen",spots={{map=1436,x=0.6849,y=0.7008}}}},text="Travel to Westfall and find Agent Kearnen for your debriefing.",flags=8},[2361]={id=2361,title="Restoring the Necklace",level=44,minLevel=37,map=1418,zone="Badlands",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={2204},starts={{kind="npc",id=6826,name="Talvash del Kissel",spots={{map=1455,x=0.3638,y=0.0361}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=6826,name="Talvash del Kissel",spots={{map=1455,x=0.3638,y=0.0361}}}},flags=8},[2378]={id=2378,title="Find the Shattered Hand",level=16,minLevel=16,map=1458,zone="Undercity",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=8,faction="Horde",exclusive={2380},starts={{kind="npc",id=6467,name="Mennet Carkad",spots={{map=1458,x=0.8351,y=0.6911}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374}}}},text="Journey to Orgrimmar and speak with Shenthul at the Cleft of Shadow.",flags=8},[2379]={id=2379,title="Zando'zan",level=16,minLevel=16,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=8,faction="Horde",nextQuest=2382,starts={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374