atcher to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar.",flags=8},[2439]={id=2439,title="The Platinum Discs",level=47,minLevel=40,map=1455,zone="Ironforge",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={2279},nextQuest=2963,starts={{kind="npc",id=5387,name="High Explorer Magellas",spots={{map=1455,x=0.6993,y=0.1855}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=7292,name="Dinita Stonemantle",spots={{map=1455,x=0.3388,y=0.5915}}}},text="Take your reward voucher to Dinita Stonemantle in the Vault of Ironforge."},[2440]={id=2440,title="The Platinum Discs",level=47,minLevel=40,map=1456,zone="Thunder Bluff",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2280},nextQuest=2965,starts={{kind="npc",id=3978,name="Sage Truthseeker",spots={{map=1456,x=0.344,y=0.4687}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3009,name="Bena Winterhoof",spots={{map=1456,x=0.4662,y=0.3317}}}},text="Take the reward voucher to Bena Winterhoof in Thunder Bluff."},[2458]={id=2458,title="Deep Cover",level=20,minLevel=20,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=8,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2460},nextQuest=2478,starts={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=7233,name="Taskmaster Fizzule",spots={{map=1413,x=0.5544,y=0.0556}}}},text="Travel to the Venture Co. Tower, north of the Sludge Fen and contact the Shattered Hand's covert operative, Taskmaster Fizzule.\n\nWhen the tower is in sight, use the Flare Gun to signal your arrival to Taskmaster Fizzule. Fire off TWO flares, then approach Taskmaster Fizzule and perform the Shattered /Salute.\n\nThese actions must be performed in the correct order, as Fizzule will attack and terminate any person he does not recognize."},[2459]={id=2459,title="Ferocitas the Dream Eater",level=8,minLevel=1,map=1438,zone="Teldrassil",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={2438},sourceItems={8049},starts={{kind="npc",id=3567,name="Tallonkai Swiftroot",spots={{map=1438,x=0.5557,y=0.5695}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3567,name="Tallonkai Swiftroot",spots={{map=1438,x=0.5557,y=0.5695}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=7235,name="Gnarlpine Mystic",count=0,spots={{map=1438,x=0.6864,y=0.523}}},{kind="item",id=8050,name="Tallonkai's Jewel",count=0}},text="Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar wants you to kill 7 Gnarlpine Mystics and find the Missing Jewel.",flags=8},[2460]={id=2460,title="The Shattered Salute",level=20,minLevel=20,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=8,faction="Horde",nextQuest=2458,starts={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",count=17,spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374}}}},text="Perform the Shattered Salute on Shenthul.",flags=2},[2478]={id=2478,title="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",level=24,minLevel=20,map=1413,zone="The Barrens",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=8,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2458},sourceItems={8066},nextQuest=2479,starts={{kind="npc",id=7233,name="Taskmaster Fizzule",spots={{map=1413,x=0.5544,y=0.0556}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=7310,name="Mutated Venture Co. Drone",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.547,y=0.057}}},{kind="npc",id=7307,name="Venture Co. Lookout",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.5475,y=0.0553}}},{kind="npc",id=7308,name="Venture Co. Patroller",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.5481,y=0.0559}}},{kind="item",id=8074,name="Gallywix's Head",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.5475,y=0.0559}}},{kind="item",id=8072,name="Silixiz's Tower Key",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.548,y=0.0597}}},{kind="item",id=8073,name="Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.5476,y=0.0556}}}},text="Steal Silixiz's Tower Key from Foreman Silixiz, then kill two Mutated Venture Co. Drones, two Venture Co. Patrollers, and two Venture Co. Lookouts.\n\nAssassinate Grand Foreman Gallywix and take his head, then pick the lock on Gallywix's lockbox and steal the Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture. Take the Cache and Gallywix's Head back to Shenthul in Orgrimmar for further instruction.\n",flags=8},[2479]={id=2479,title="Hinott's Assistance",level=26,minLevel=20,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=8,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2478},nextQuest=2480,starts={{kind="npc",id=3401,name="Shenthul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4305,y=0.5374}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=2391,name="Serge Hinott",spots={{map=1424,x=0.6163,y=0.1919}}}},text="Travel to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills and deliver the Sample of Zanzil's Mixture to Serge Hinott.\n\nTo get to Tarren Mill, take the Zeppelin to the Undercity and follow the road south through Silverpine and towards Hillsbrad. Follow the signs!\n\n"},[2480]={id=2480,title="Hinott's Assistance",level=20,minLevel=20,map=1424,zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=8,faction="Horde",requiresAny={2479},starts={{kind="npc",id=2391,name="Serge Hinott",spots={{map=1424,x=0.6163,y=0.1919}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=2391,name="Serge Hinott",spots={{map=1424,x=0.6163,y=0.1919}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="Cure Completed",spots={{map=1424,x=0.6157,y=0.1921}}}},text="Wait for Serge Hinott to complete the cure.",flags=2},[2498]={id=2498,title="Return to Denalan",level=9,minLevel=4,map=1438,zone="Teldrassil",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={923},nextQuest=2499,starts={{kind="npc",id=3517,name="Rellian Greenspyre",spots={{map=1457,x=0.3818,y=0.2164}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=2080,name="Denalan",spots={{map=1438,x=0.609,y=0.6849}}}},text="Rellian Greenspyre wants you to speak with Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",flags=8},[2499]={id=2499,title="Oakenscowl",level=9,minLevel=4,map=1438,zone="Teldrassil",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={2498},starts={{kind="npc",id=2080,name="Denalan",spots={{map=1438,x=0.609,y=0.6849}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=2080,name="Denalan",spots={