me="Gemstone of Smolderthorn",count=0},{kind="item",id=12337,name="Gemstone of Bloodaxe",count=0},{kind="item",id=12219,name="Unadorned Seal of Ascension",count=0}},text="Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of Ascension, to Vaelan.\n\nThe Generals, as told to you by Vaelan, are: War Master Voone of the Smolderthorn; Highlord Omokk of the Spirestone; and Overlord Wyrmthalak of the Bloodaxe.",dungeon="Lower Blackrock Spire",flags=8},[4743]={id=4743,title="Seal of Ascension",level=60,minLevel=57,map=253,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={4742},sourceItems={12300,12323},starts={{kind="npc",id=10299,name="Scarshield Infiltrator"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10299,name="Scarshield Infiltrator"}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12324,name="Forged Seal of Ascension",count=0,spots={{map=1445,x=0.5637,y=0.8783}}}},text="Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.\n\nIt is at that moment which you must place the Unforged Seal of Ascension before the great beast. You must then be quick to use the Orb of Draconic Energy on his weakened form and claim dominion over his mental faculties. Control the beast and force the Flames of the Black Dragonflight upon the Unforged Seal of Ascension!",dungeon="Upper Blackrock Spire"},[4761]={id=4761,title="Thundris Windweaver",level=15,minLevel=11,map=1439,zone="Darkshore",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={984},nextQuest=4762,starts={{kind="npc",id=3693,name="Terenthis",spots={{map=1439,x=0.3937,y=0.4348}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3649,name="Thundris Windweaver",spots={{map=1439,x=0.374,y=0.4013}}}},text="Speak with Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.",flags=8},[4762]={id=4762,title="The Cliffspring River",level=15,minLevel=11,map=1439,zone="Darkshore",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={4761},nextQuest=4763,starts={{kind="npc",id=3649,name="Thundris Windweaver",spots={{map=1439,x=0.374,y=0.4013}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3649,name="Thundris Windweaver",spots={{map=1439,x=0.374,y=0.4013}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12349,name="Cliffspring River Sample",count=0,spots={{map=1439,x=0.5084,y=0.2563}}}},text="Travel north of Auberdine to the first waterfall along the Cliffspring River and draw a sample from the pool there.\n\nReturn to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine with the Cliffspring River Sample."},[4763]={id=4763,title="The Blackwood Corrupted",level=18,minLevel=15,map=1439,zone="Darkshore",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={4762},sourceItems={12341,12342,12343,12347},starts={{kind="npc",id=3649,name="Thundris Windweaver",spots={{map=1439,x=0.374,y=0.4013}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3649,name="Thundris Windweaver",spots={{map=1439,x=0.374,y=0.4013}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12355,name="Talisman of Corruption",count=0,spots={{map=1439,x=0.5248,y=0.3339}}}},text="Fill the Empty Cleansing Bowl at the Auberdine Moonwell.\n\nGather a sample of fruit, nut, and grain from the northern Blackwood furbolg camps.\n\nMix the bowl and place it near the bonfire closest to the Cliffspring River at the northern camp, thus summoning the satyr corruptor.\n\nTake the Talisman of Corruption and bring it to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine."},[4764]={id=4764,title="Doomrigger's Clasp",level=60,minLevel=57,map=253,zone="Other",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",nextQuest=4765,starts={{kind="npc",id=9565,name="Mayara Brightwing",spots={{map=1428,x=0.8484,y=0.6912}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=9565,name="Mayara Brightwing",spots={{map=1428,x=0.8484,y=0.6912}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12352,name="Doomrigger's Clasp",count=0}},text="Bring Doomrigger's Clasp to Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.",dungeon="Upper Blackrock Spire",flags=72},[4765]={id=4765,title="Delivery to Ridgewell",level=60,minLevel=57,map=25