,spots={{map=1418,x=0.0588,y=0.4763}}}},text="Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath.\n"},[4984]={id=4984,title="The Wildlife Suffers Too",level=54,minLevel=51,map=1422,zone="Western Plaguelands",raceMask=0,classMask=0,nextQuest=4985,starts={{kind="npc",id=10739,name="Mulgris Deepriver",spots={{map=1422,x=0.5373,y=0.6466}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10739,name="Mulgris Deepriver",spots={{map=1422,x=0.5373,y=0.6466}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=1817,name="Diseased Wolf",count=0,spots={{map=1422,x=0.5253,y=0.7045}}}},text="Destroy 8 Diseased Wolves, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.\n\n",flags=8},[4985]={id=4985,title="The Wildlife Suffers Too",level=56,minLevel=51,map=1422,zone="Western Plaguelands",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={4984},starts={{kind="npc",id=10739,name="Mulgris Deepriver",spots={{map=1422,x=0.5373,y=0.6466}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10739,name="Mulgris Deepriver",spots={{map=1422,x=0.5373,y=0.6466}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=1816,name="Diseased Grizzly",count=0,spots={{map=1422,x=0.672,y=0.4819}}}},text="Destroy 8 Diseased Grizzlies, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.",flags=8},[4986]={id=4986,title="Glyphed Oaken Branch",level=56,minLevel=51,map=1422,zone="Western Plaguelands",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={4985},starts={{kind="npc",id=10739,name="Mulgris Deepriver",spots={{map=1422,x=0.5373,y=0.6466}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=4217,name="Mathrengyl Bearwalker",spots={{map=1457,x=0.3537,y=0.084}}}},text="Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance."},[4987]={id=4987,title="Glyphed Oaken Branch",level=56,minLevel=51,map=1422,zone="Western Plaguelands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={4985},starts={{kind="npc",id=10