written Log to Kelek Skykeeper in southern Felwood."},[5141]={id=5141,title="Dragonscale Leatherworking",level=55,minLevel=40,map=1447,zone="Azshara",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",exclusive={5143,5144},requiredSkill={165,225},starts={{kind="npc",id=7866,name="Peter Galen",spots={{map=1447,x=0.3759,y=0.6542}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=7866,name="Peter Galen",spots={{map=1447,x=0.3759,y=0.6542}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=8203,name="Tough Scorpid Breastplate",count=0},{kind="item",id=8204,name="Tough Scorpid Gloves",count=0},{kind="item",id=8165,name="Worn Dragonscale",count=0,spots={{map=1444,x=0.5436,y=0.1015},{map=1425,x=0.6539,y=0.2499},{map=1425,x=0.653,y=0.249}}}},text="Bring 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 Tough Scorpid Gloves, and 10 Worn Dragonscales to Peter Galen in Azshara.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you access to the Dragonscale Leatherworking arts.\n\nThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Elemental Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",flags=8},[5142]={id=5142,title="Little Pamela",level=55,minLevel=50,map=1423,zone="Eastern Plaguelands",raceMask=0,classMask=0,exclusive={5601},nextQuest=5149,starts={{kind="npc",id=10927,name="Marlene Redpath",spots={{map=1422,x=0.4917,y=0.7857}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10926,name="Pamela Redpath",spots={{map=1423,x=0.3115,y=0.7798}}}},text="Find Pamela Redpath.",flags=8},[5143]={id=5143,title="Tribal Leatherworking",level=55,minLevel=40,map=1444,zone="Feralas",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={2853},exclusive={5141,5144},requiredSkill={165,225},starts={{kind="npc",id=7870,name="Caryssia Moonhunter",spots={{map=1444,x=0.8942,y=0.4655}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=7870,name="Caryssia Moonhunter",spots={{map=1444,x=0.8942,y=0.4655}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=8211,name="Wild Leather Vest",count=0},{kind="item",id=8214,name="Wild Leather Helmet",count=0}},text="Bring a Wild Leather V