",spots={{map=1452,x=0.613,y=0.3707}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13352,name="Vosh'gajin's Snakestone",count=0}},text="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin. Recover Vosh'gajin's Snakestone and return to Kilram.",flags=8},[5307]={id=5307,title="Corruption",level=60,minLevel=50,map=1452,zone="Winterspring",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiredSkill={164,250},requiredSpec=9787,starts={{kind="npc",id=11193,name="Seril Scourgebane",spots={{map=1452,x=0.6133,y=0.3719}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11193,name="Seril Scourgebane",spots={{map=1452,x=0.6133,y=0.3719}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13350,name="Insignia of the Black Guard",count=0}},text="Find the Black Guard Swordsmith in Stratholme and destroy him. Recover the Insignia of the Black Guard and return to Seril Scourgebane.",flags=8},[5321]={id=5321,title="The Sleeper Has Awakened",level=20,minLevel=17,map=1439,zone="Darkshore",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",starts={{kind="npc",id=11218,name="Kerlonian Evershade",spots={{map=1439,x=0.444,y=0.7643}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11219,name="Liladris Moonriver",spots={{map=1440,x=0.2726,y=0.3558}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="Escort Kerlonian Evershade on the road south to his bag",spots={{map=1439,x=0.42,y=0.905}}}},text="Escort Kerlonian Evershade to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",flags=2},[5341]={id=5341,title="Barov Family Fortune",level=60,minLevel=52,map=306,zone="Other",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",nextQuest=5342,starts={{kind="npc",id=11022,name="Alexi Barov",spots={{map=1420,x=0.8306,y=0.716}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11022,name="Alexi Barov",spots={{map=1420,x=0.8306,y=0.716}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13471,name="The Deed to Brill",count=0},{kind="item",id=13448,name="The Deed to Caer Darrow",count=0},{kind="item",id=13450,name="The Deed to Southshore",count=0},{kind="item",id=13451,name="The Deed to Tarren Mill",count=0}},text="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.",dungeon="Scholomance",flags=8},[5342]={id=5342,title="The Last Barov",level=60,minLevel=52,map=1422,zone="Western Plaguelands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={5341},starts={{kind="npc",id=11022,name="Alexi Barov",spots={{map=1420,x=0.8306,y=0.716}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11022,name="Alexi Barov",spots={{map=1420,x=0.8306,y=0.716}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13469,name="Head of Weldon Barov",count=0,spots={{map=1422,x=0.4345,y=0.8373}}}},text="Travel to Chillwind Camp - Alliance territory - and assassinate Weldon Barov. Take his head and return to Alexi Barov.\n\nBe warned, Weldon will probably be well protected by Alliance scum."},[5343]={id=5343,title="Barov Family Fortune",level=60,minLevel=52,map=306,zone="Other",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",nextQuest=5344,starts={{kind="npc",id=11023,name="Weldon Barov",spots={{map=1422,x=0.4345,y=0.8373}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11023,name="Weldon Barov",spots={{map=1422,x=0.4345,y=0.8373}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13471,name="The Deed to Brill",count=0},{kind="item",id=13448,name="The Deed to Caer Darrow",count=0},{kind="item",id=13450,name="The Deed to Southshore",count=0},{kind="item",id=13451,name="The Deed to Tarren Mill",count=0}},text="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.",dungeon="Scholomance",flags=8},[5344]={id=5344,title="The Last Barov",level=60,minLevel=52,map=1422,zone="Western Plaguelands",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={5343},starts={{kind="npc",id=11023,name="Weldon Barov",spots={{map=1422,x=0.4345,y=0.8373}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11023,name="Weldon Barov",spots={{map=1422,x=0.4345,y=0.8373}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13470,name="Head of Alexi Barov",count=0,spots={{map=1420,x=0.8306,y=0.716}}}},text="Travel to the Bulwark - Horde territory - and assassinate Alexi Barov. Take his head and return to Weldon Barov.\n\nBe warned, Alexi will probably be well protected by Horde filth."},[5361]={id=5361,title="Family Tree",level=35,minLevel=32,map=1441,zone="Thousand Needles",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=10537,name="Cliffwatcher Longhorn",spots={{map=1441,x=0.4567,y=0.5074}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11259,name="Nataka Longhorn",spots={{map=1443,x=0.5541,y=0.5581}}}},text="Deliver Cliffwatcher Longhorn Report to Nataka Longhorn at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace."},[5381]={id=5381,title="Hand of Iruxos",level=38,minLevel=32,map=1443,zone="Desolace",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",nextQuest=5581,starts={{kind="npc",id=11624,name="Taiga Wisemane",spots={{map=1443,x=0.2582,y=0.6821}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11624,name="Taiga Wisemane",spots={{map=1443,x=0.2582,y=0.6821}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13542,name="Demon Box",count=0,spots={{map=1443,x=0.55,y=0.266}}}},text="Retrieve the Demon Box from Thunder Axe Fortress, and return it, along with the Demon Pick to Taiga Wisemane in Shadowprey Village.\n"},[5382]={id=5382,title="Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher",level=60,minLevel=55,map=306,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,nextQuest=5515,starts={{kind="npc",id=11216,name="Eva Sarkhoff",spots={{map=1422,x=0.7022,y=0.7371}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11216,name="Eva Sarkhoff",spots={{map=1422,x=0.7022,y=0.7371}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=11261,name="Doctor Theolen Krastinov",count=0},{kind="object",id=176544,name="Remains of Eva Sarkhoff Burned",count=0},{kind="object",id=176545,name="Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff Burned",count=0}},text="Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete.\n",dungeon="Scholomance",flags=8},[5384]={id=5384,title="Kirtonos the Herald",level=60,minLevel=55,map=306,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={5515},nextQuest=5461,starts={{kind="npc",id=11216,name="Eva Sarkhoff",spots={{map=1422,x=0.7022,y=0.7371}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11216,name="Eva Sarkhoff",spots={{map=1422,x=0.7022,y=0.7371}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=10506,name="Kirtonos the Herald",count=0}},text="Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.\n\nFight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff.\n",dungeon="Scholomance"},[5385]={id=5385,title="The Remains of Trey Lightforge",level=57,minLevel=49,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={5204},starts={{kind="npc",id=11020,name="Remains of Trey Lightforge",spots={{map=1448,x=0.385,y=0.5041}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11019,name="Jessir Moonbow",spots={{map=1448,x=0.5135,y=0.8201}}}},text="Return the Remains of Trey Lightforge to Jessir Moonbow in Felwood."},[5386]={id=5386,title="Catch of the Day",level=37,minLevel=32,map=1443,zone="Desolace",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=11259,name="Nataka Longhorn",spots={{map=1443,x=0.5541,y=0.5581}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11259,name="Nataka Longhorn",spots={{map=1443,x=0.5541,y=0.5581}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13546,name="Bloodbelly Fish",count=0,spots={{map=1443,x=0.2245,y=0.7312}}}},text="Talk to Jinar'Zillen at Shadowprey Village, and then bring Nataka Longhorn 2 Bloodbelly fish.",flags=8},[5401]={id=5401,title="Argent Dawn Commission",level=55,minLevel=50,map=1422,zone="Western Plaguelands",raceMask=0,classMask=0,exclusive={5405,5503},starts={{kind="npc",id=10840,name="Argent Officer Pureheart",spots={{map=1422,x=0.4297,y=0.8355}}}},ends={{kind="