ts={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=16869,name="The Skull of Scryer",count=0,spots={{map=1452,x=0.5271,y=0.5589}}}},text="You must find the blue dragonflight drake champion, Scryer, and slay him. Pry his skull from his corpse and return it to Emberstrife.\n\nYou know that Scryer can be found in Winterspring.",flags=72},[6583]={id=6583,title="The Test of Skulls, Somnus",level=60,minLevel=55,map=1445,zone="Dustwallow Marsh",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={6570},starts={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=16870,name="The Skull of Somnus",count=0,spots={{map=1435,x=0.76,y=0.666}}}},text="Destroy the drake champion of the Green Flight, Somnus. Take his skull and return it to Emberstrife.",flags=72},[6584]={id=6584,title="The Test of Skulls, Chronalis",level=60,minLevel=55,map=1445,zone="Dustwallow Marsh",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={6570},starts={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=16871,name="The Skull of Chronalis",count=0,spots={{map=1446,x=0.6416,y=0.4849}}}},text="Guarding the Caverns of Time in the Tanaris Desert is Chronalis, child of Nozdormu. Destroy him and return his skull to Emberstrife.",flags=72},[6585]={id=6585,title="The Test of Skulls, Axtroz",level=60,minLevel=55,map=1445,zone="Dustwallow Marsh",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAll={6582,6583,6584},nextQuest=6601,starts={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=16872,name="The Skull of Axtroz",count=0,spots={{map=1437,x=0.8182,y=0.4824}}}},text="Travel to Grim Batol and track down Axtroz, drake champion of the Red Flight. Destroy him and take his skull. Return the skull to Emberstrife.",flags=72},[6601]={id=6601,title="Ascension...",level=60,minLevel=55,map=1445,zone="Dustwallow Marsh",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={6585},nextQuest=6602,starts={{kind="npc",id=10321,name="Emberstrife",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5666,y=0.8772}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10182,name="Rexxar",spots={{map=1443,x=0.54,y=0.02}}}},text="It would appear as if the charade is over. You know that the Amulet of Draconic Subversion that Myranda the Hag created for you will not function inside Blackrock Spire. Perhaps you should find Rexxar and explain your predicament. Show him the Dull Drakefire Amulet. Hopefully he will know what to do next."},[6602]={id=6602,title="Blood of the Black Dragon Champion",level=60,minLevel=55,map=253,zone="Other",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={6601},starts={{kind="npc",id=10182,name="Rexxar",spots={{map=1443,x=0.54,y=0.02}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10182,name="Rexxar",spots={{map=1443,x=0.54,y=0.02}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=16663,name="Blood of the Black Dragon Champion",count=0}},text="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath. Gather his blood and return it to Rexxar.",dungeon="Upper Blackrock Spire",flags=72},[6603]={id=6603,title="Trouble in Winterspring!",level=56,minLevel=52,map=1452,zone="Winterspring",raceMask=0,classMask=0,nextQuest=5082,starts={{kind="npc",id=11754,name="Meggi Peppinrocker",spots={{map=1452,x=0.6066,y=0.3817}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=9298,name="Donova Snowden",spots={{map=1452,x=0.3127,y=0.4516}}}},text="Find Donova Snowden near the hot springs in Winterspring.",flags=8},[6604]={id=6604,title="Enraged Wildkin",level=59,minLevel=53,map=1452,zone="Winterspring",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",nextQuest=4861,starts={{kind="npc",id=11755,name="Harlo Wigglesworth",spots={{map=1452,x=0.6112,y=0.3843}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10301,name="Jaron Stoneshaper",spots={{map=1452,x=0.5214,y=0.3043}}}},text="Speak with Jaron Stoneshaper at Starfall Village.",flags=8},[6605]={id=6605,title="A Strange One",level=54,minLevel=49,map=1452,zone="Winterspring",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",nextQuest=4505,starts={{kind="npc",id=11755,name="Harlo Wigglesworth",spots={{map=1452,x=0.6112,y=0.3843}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=9996,name="Winna Hazzard",spots={{map=1448,x=0.3421,y=0.5234}}}},text="Speak with Winna Hazzard in Felwood.",flags=8},[6606]={id=6606,title="A Little Luck",level=60,minLevel=55,map=1452,zone="Winterspring",raceMask=0,classMask=0,nextQuest=969,starts={{kind="npc",id=11755,name="Harlo Wigglesworth",spots={{map=1452,x=0.6112,y=0.3843}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=10307,name="Witch Doctor Mau'ari",spots={{map=1452,x=0.6192,y=0.383}}}},text="Speak with Witch Doctor Mau'ari in Everlook.",flags=8},[6607]={id=6607,title="Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1445,zone="Dustwallow Marsh",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiredSkill={356,225},starts={{kind="npc",id=12919,name="Nat Pagle",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5861,y=0.6006}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12919,name="Nat Pagle",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5861,y=0.6006}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=16967,name="Feralas Ahi",count=0,spots={{map=1444,x=0.621,y=0.514}}},{kind="item",id=16970,name="Misty Reed Mahi Mahi",count=0,spots={{map=1435,x=0.744,y=0.037}}},{kind="item",id=16968,name="Sar'theris Striker",count=0,spots={{map=1443,x=0.222,y=0.876}}},{kind="item",id=16969,name="Savage Coast Blue Sailfin",count=0,spots={{map=1434,x=0.135,y=0.157}}}},text="Nat Pagle wants you to catch the following fish:\n\nMisty Reed Mahi Mahi from the Misty Reed Strand in the Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nA Sar'theris Striker from the Sar'theris Strand in Desolace.\n\nFeralas Ahi from the Verdantis River of Feralas.\n\nSavage Coast Blue Sailfin from the Savage Coast of Stranglethorn Vale.\n\nReturn to Nat Pagle when you have reeled them all in!",flags=8},[6608]={id=6608,title="You Too Good.",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiredSkill={356,225},nextQuest=6607,starts={{kind="npc",id=3332,name="Lumak",spots={{map=1454,x=0.698,y=0.2921}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12919,name="Nat Pagle",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5861,y=0.6006}}}},text="You think Lumak is trying to tell you that he can no longer help you improve your fishing skill. You may want to try to find his friend, Nat Pagle, a human fishing off one of the islands south of Theramore (at least that's what you think Lumak said).",flags=8},[6609]={id=6609,title="I Got Nothin' Left!",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1455,zone="Ironforge",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiredSkill={356,225},nextQuest=6607,starts={{kind="npc",id=5161,name="Grimnur Stonebrand",spots={{map=1455,x=0.4807,y=0.0691}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12919,name="Nat Pagle",spots={{map=1445,x=0.5861,y=0.6006}}}},text="Travel to Kalimdor, to the coastal city of Theramore. From there you must search for an island, south of the main town. Nat Pagle awaits your arrival!",flags=8},[6610]={id=6610,title="Clamlette Surprise",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1446,zone="Tanaris",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiredSkill={185,225},starts={{kind="npc",id=8125,name="Dirge Quikcleave",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5263,y=0.2811}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=8125,name="Dirge Quikcleave",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5263,y=0.2811}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12207,name="Giant Egg",count=0,spots={{map=1422,x=0.2989,y=0.5468},{map=1425,x=0.3388,y=0.6321},{map=1425,x=0.5129,y=0.5005}}},{kind="item",id=7974,name="Zesty Clam Meat",count=0},{kind="item",id=8932,name="Alterac Swiss",count=0,spots={{map=1453,x=0.6917,y=0.8272},{map=1434,x=0.4095,y=0.839},{map=1422,x=0.3574,y=0.562},{map=1419,x=0.6546,y=0.3337}}}},text="Dirge Quikcleave wants you to get the following items:\n\n12 Giant Eggs. You will find those on the Rocs wandering Tanaris or any other species of large bird.\n\n10 pieces of Zesty Clam Meat. You can find those in clams, naturally!\n\n20 pieces of Alterac Swiss. Get thee to a cheesery!\n\nGather all of the items and return to Dirge.",flags=8},[6611]={id=6611,title="To Gadgetzan You Go!",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiredSkill={185,225},nextQuest=6610,starts={{kind="npc",id=3399,name="Zamja",spots={{map=1454,x=0.574,y=0.5396}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=8125,name="Dirge Quikcleave",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5263,y=0.2811}}}},text="Travel to Gadgetzan in the Tanaris desert and speak with Dirge Quikcleave about advancing your cooking career.",flags=8},[6612]={id=6612,title="I Know A Guy...",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1455,zone="Ironforge",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiredSkill={185,225},nextQuest=6610,starts={{kind="npc",id=5159,name="Daryl Riknussun",spots={{map=1455,x=0.6008,y=0.3643}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=8125,name="Dirge Quikcleave",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5263,y=0.2811}}}},text="Travel to Gadgetzan in the Tanaris desert and speak with Dirge Quikcleave about advancing your cooking career.\n",flags=8},[6621]={id=6621,title="King of the Foulweald",level=26,minLevel=21,map=1440,zone="Ashenvale",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={216},starts={{kind="npc",id=12757,name="Karang Amakkar",spots={{map=1440,x=0.119,y=0.3454}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12757,name="Karang Amakkar",spots={{map=1440,x=0.119,y=0.3454}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=16976,name="Murgut's Totem",count=0,spots={{map=1440,x=0.5643,y=0.635},{map=1440,x=0.565,y=0.635}}}},text="Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar."},[6622]={id=6622,title="Triage",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1417,zone="Arathi Highlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiredSkill={129,225},starts={{kind="npc",id=12920,name="Doctor Gregory Victor",spots={{map=1417,x=0.7341,y=0.3689}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12920,name="Doctor Gregory Victor",spots={{map=1417,x=0.7341,y=0.3689}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="15 Patients Saved!",spots={{map=1445,x=0.6779,y=0.4906}}}},text="Save patients by using Triage Bandages to tend to their wounds. You must save 15 patients before 6 of them die from their injuries.\n\nRemember the order of triage! Critically Injured Soldiers die the fastest followed by Badly Injured Soldiers. Injured Soldiers take the longest to die and should be saved AFTER your Critically Injured and Badly Injured Soldiers have been triaged.",flags=2},[6623]={id=6623,title="Horde Trauma",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiredSkill={129,225},nextQuest=6622,starts={{kind="npc",id=3373,name="Arnok",spots={{map=1454,x=0.3418,y=0.8458}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12920,name="Doctor Gregory Victor",spots={{map=1417,x=0.7341,y=0.3689}}}},text="Travel to Hammerfall in the Arathi Highlands and speak with Doctor Gregory Victor about joining the ranks of Horde Trauma.\n",flags=8},[6624]={id=6624,title="Triage",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1445,zone="Dustwallow Marsh",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiredSkill={129,225},starts={{kind="npc",id=12939,name="Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen",spots={{map=1445,x=0.6776,y=0.4897}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12939,name="Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen",spots={{map=1445,x=0.6776,y=0.4897}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="15 Patients Saved!",spots={{map=1445,x=0.6779,y=0.4906}}}},text="Save patients by using Triage Bandages to tend to their wounds. You must save 15 patients before 6 of them die from their injuries.\n\nRemember the order of triage! Critically Injured Soldiers die the fastest followed by Badly Injured Soldiers. Injured Soldiers take the longest to die and should be saved AFTER your Critically Injured and Badly Injured Soldiers have been triaged.",flags=2},[6625]={id=6625,title="Alliance Trauma",level=45,minLevel=35,map=1455,zone="Ironforge",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiredSkill={129,225},nextQuest=6624,starts={{kind="npc",id=5150,name="Nissa Firestone",spots={{map=1455,x=0.5509,y=0.5826}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12939,name="Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen",spots={{map=1445,x=0.6776,y=0.4897}}}},text="Travel to Theramore in the Dustwallow Marsh and speak with Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen about joining the ranks of Alliance Trauma.",flags=8},[6626]={id=6626,title="A Host of Evil",level=35,minLevel=28,map=300,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,starts={{kind="npc",id=12866,name="Myriam Moonsinger",spots={{map=1413,x=0.4901,y=0.9494}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12866,name="Myriam Moonsinger",spots={{map=1413,x=0.4901,y=0.9494}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=7873,name="Razorfen Battleguard",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.4706,y=0.8831}}},{kind="npc",id=7874,name="Razorfen Thornweaver",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.4865,y=0.8971},{map=1441,x=0.4011,y=0.2973}}},{kind="npc",id=7872,name="Death's Head Cultist",count=0,spots={{map=1413,x=0.4861,y=0.8993},{map=1441,x=0.4034,y=0.2998}}}},text="Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs.",dungeon="Razorfen Downs",flags=8},[6627]={id=6627,title="Test of Lore",level=30,minLevel=25,map=1441,zone="Thousand Needles",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={1154},nextQuest=1159,starts={{kind="npc",id=4489,name="Braug Dimspirit",spots={{map=1442,x=0.788,y=0.4569}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=4489,name="Braug Dimspirit",spots={{map=1442,x=0.788,y=0.4569}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="Answer Braug Dimspirit's question correctly",spots={{map=1442,x=0.7875,y=0.4563}}}},text="Answer Braug Dimspirit's question successfully and then speak to him again. He will remain in Stonetalon Mountains when you are ready.",flags=10},[6628]={id=6628,title="Test of Lore",level=30,minLevel=25,map=1441,zone="Thousand Needles",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={1160},nextQuest=1394,starts={{kind="npc",id=4488,name="Parqual Fintallas",spots={{map=1458,x=0.578,y=0.6542}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=4488,name="Parqual Fintallas",spots={{map=1458,x=0.578,y=0.6542}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="Answer Parqual Fintallas' question correctly",spots={{map=1458,x=0.5772,y=0.6522}}}},text="Answer Parqual Fintallas' question successfully and then speak to him again. He will remain in the Undercity until you are ready.",flags=10},[6629]={id=6629,title="Kill Grundig Darkcloud",level=18,minLevel=12,map=1442,zone="Stonetalon Mountains",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={6548},starts={{kind="npc",id=11857,name="Makaba Flathoof",spots={{map=1413,x=0.3519,y=0.2776}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11857,name="Makaba Flathoof",spots={{map=1413,x=0.3519,y=0.2776}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=11858,name="Grundig Darkcloud",count=0,spots={{map=1442,x=0.7365,y=0.8612}}},{kind="npc",id=11912,name="Grimtotem Brute",count=0,spots={{map=1442,x=0.778,y=0.8573}}}},text="Kill Grundig Darkcloud and 6 Grimtotem Brutes, and return to Makaba Flathoof near the southeastern edge of Stonetalon.\n",flags=8},[6641]={id=6641,title="Vorsha the Lasher",level=23,minLevel=20,map=1440,zone="Ashenvale",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=12717,name="Muglash",spots={{map=1440,x=0.1206,y=0.3463}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12863,name="Warsong Runner",spots={{map=1440,x=0.1222,y=0.3422}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="Defeat Vorsha the Lasher",spots={{map=1440,x=0.0959,y=0.2758}}}},text="Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.\n\nIf you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher.",flags=2},[6642]={id=6