t of Gnome Hair.",flags=72},[7363]={id=7363,title="The Human Condition",level=60,minLevel=51,map=1459,zone="Alterac Valley",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",objectives={{kind="item",id=18144,name="Human Bone Chip",count=0,spots={{map=1459,x=0.4996,y=0.7717},{map=1459,x=0.4486,y=0.2148}}}},text="You have been tasked with slaying opposing human players in Alterac Valley.\n\nKill a human and return to Commander Louis Philips (who wanders between the front lines and Frostwolf keep) with a Human Bone Chip.\n\nA cure for the human condition is close at hand!",flags=72},[7364]={id=7364,title="Gnomeregan Bounty",level=60,minLevel=51,map=1459,zone="Alterac Valley",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",objectives={{kind="item",id=18145,name="Tauren Hoof",count=0,spots={{map=1459,x=0.4996,y=0.7717},{map=1459,x=0.4774,y=0.7173}}}},text="You have been tasked with slaying opposing tauren players in Alterac Valley.\n\nKill a tauren and return to Dirk Swindle at Dun'Baldar with a Tauren Hoof.",flags=72},[7365]={id=7365,title="Staghelm's Requiem",level=60,minLevel=51,map=1459,zone="Alterac Valley",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",objectives={{kind="item",id=18146,name="Darkspear Troll Mojo",count=0,spots={{map=1459,x=0.4996,y=0.7717},{map=1459,x=0.4486,y=0.2148},{map=1459,x=0.5243,y=0.0459}}}},text="You have been tasked with slaying opposing troll players in Alterac Valley.\n\nKill a troll and return to Athramanis at Dun'Baldar with Darkspear Troll Mojo.",flags=72},[7366]={id=7366,title="The Archbishop's Mercy",level=60,minLevel=51,map=1459,zone="Alterac Valley",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",objectives={{kind="item",id=18147,name="Forsaken Heart",count=0,spots={{map=1459,x=0.4996,y=0.7717},{map=1459,x=0.4774,y=0.7173}}}},text="You have been tasked with slaying opposing Forsaken players in Alterac Valley.\n\nKill a Forsaken and return to Commander Karl Philips (who wanders between the lumber mill and the mine) with a 