uardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated.\n\nEnter the Prison of Immol'thar and eradicate the foul demon that stands at its heart. Finally, confront Prince Tortheldrin in Athenaeum.\n\nReturn to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.",dungeon="Dire Maul: West",flags=8},[7462]={id=7462,title="The Treasure of the Shen'dralar",level=60,minLevel=56,map=234,zone="Other",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7461},starts={{kind="npc",id=14358,name="Shen'dralar Ancient"}},ends={{kind="object",id=179517,name="Treasure of the Shen'dralar"}},text="Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!",flags=8},[7463]={id=7463,title="Arcane Refreshment",level=60,minLevel=60,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=128,starts={{kind="npc",id=14368,name="Lorekeeper Lydros"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14368,name="Lorekeeper Lydros"}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18299,name="Hydrospawn Essence",count=0}},text="Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence.",dungeon="Dire Maul: East",flags=8},[7481]={id=7481,title="Elven Legends",level=60,minLevel=54,map=234,zone="Other",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=14373,name="Sage Korolusk",spots={{map=1444,x=0.744,y=0.44}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14373,name="Sage Korolusk",spots={{map=1444,x=0.744,y=0.44}}}},objectives={{kind="object",id=179544,name="Skeletal Remains of Telmius Dreamseeker",count=0}},text="Search Dire Maul for Telmius Dreamseeker. Report back to Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache with whatever information that you may find.",dungeon="Dire Maul: West",flags=10},[7482]={id=7482,title="Elven Legends",level=60,minLevel=54,map=234,zone="Other",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alli