f the essence.\n\nThe last step before returning to me is to slay the beast and drive the Heated Ancient Blade into her corpse.\n\nDo this and Quel'Serrar will be yours.",flags=64},[7541]={id=7541,title="Service to the Horde",level=40,minLevel=30,map=1445,zone="Dustwallow Marsh",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",requiresAny={1262},starts={{kind="npc",id=4047,name="Zor Lonetree",spots={{map=1454,x=0.3893,y=0.384}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=4047,name="Zor Lonetree",spots={{map=1454,x=0.3893,y=0.384}}}},flags=8},[7562]={id=7562,title="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",level=58,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=0,classMask=256,nextQuest=7563,starts={{kind="npc",id=5520,name="Spackle Thornberry",spots={{map=1453,x=0.3953,y=0.8453}}},{kind="npc",id=5815,name="Kurgul",spots={{map=1454,x=0.4752,y=0.4672}}},{kind="npc",id=6382,name="Jubahl Corpseseeker",spots={{map=1455,x=0.527,y=0.0608}}},{kind="npc",id=12807,name="Greshka",spots={{map=1435,x=0.4858,y=0.5527}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},text="Speak with Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."},[7563]={id=7563,title="Rage of Blood",level=58,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,nextQuest=7564,starts={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18590,name="Raging Beast's Blood",count=0,spots={{map=1452,x=0.4815,y=0.464},{map=1452,x=0.612,y=0.298},{map=1452,x=0.6387,y=0.6106}}}},text="Bring 30 bottles of Raging Beast's Blood to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.",flags=8},[7564]={id=7564,title="Wildeyes",level=58,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7563},starts={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},text="Bring the Case of Blood to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes."},[7581]={id=7581,title="The Prison's Bindings",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1419,zone="Blasted Lands",raceMask=0,classMask=256,nextQuest=7583,starts={{kind="npc",id=14463,name="Daio the Decrepit",spots={{map=1419,x=0.3413,y=0.5014}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14463,name="Daio the Decrepit",spots={{map=1419,x=0.3413,y=0.5014}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18603,name="Satyr Blood",count=0}},text="Travel to Dire Maul in Feralas and recover 15 Satyr Blood from the Wildspawn Satyr that inhabit the Warpwood Quarter. Return to Daio in the Tainted Scar when this is done.\n",flags=8},[7582]={id=7582,title="The Prison's Casing",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1419,zone="Blasted Lands",raceMask=0,classMask=256,nextQuest=7583,starts={{kind="npc",id=14463,name="Daio the Decrepit",spots={{map=1419,x=0.3413,y=0.5014}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14463,name="Daio the Decrepit",spots={{map=1419,x=0.3413,y=0.5014}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18604,name="Tears of the Hederine",count=0,spots={{map=1452,x=0.5546,y=0.8422},{map=1452,x=0.5698,y=0.8803},{map=1452,x=0.5769,y=0.7978}}}},text="Travel to Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring and recover 5 Tears of the Hederine from the Hederine demons that occupy the gorge. Return to Daio in the Tainted Scar when you have completed this task.",flags=8},[7583]={id=7583,title="Suppression",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1419,zone="Blasted Lands",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAll={7581,7582},starts={{kind="npc",id=14463,name="Daio the Decrepit",spots={{map=1419,x=0.3413,y=0.5014}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14463,name="Daio the Decrepit",spots={{map=1419,x=0.3413,y=0.5014}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18605,name="Imprisoned Doomguard",count=0,spots={{map=1419,x=0.3795,y=0.6918}}}},text="Venture forth into the Tainted Scar and locate a Doomguard Commander.\n\nUse the Glowing Crystal Prison on the Doomguard Commander. Be prepared for a ferocious onslaught of attacks, as the demon attempts to escape capture.\n\nShould you succeed, return the Imprisoned Doomguard to Daio in the Tainted Scar.",flags=64},[7601]={id=7601,title="What Niby Commands",level=50,minLevel=50,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=256,nextQuest=7602,starts={{kind="npc",id=14469,name="Niby the Almighty",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4138,y=0.4485}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14470,name="Impsy",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4136,y=0.4502}}}},text="Speak with Impsy in Felwood.",flags=8},[7602]={id=7602,title="Flawless Fel Essence",level=55,minLevel=50,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7601},nextQuest=7603,starts={{kind="npc",id=14470,name="Impsy",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4136,y=0.4502}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14470,name="Impsy",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4136,y=0.4502}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18624,name="Flawless Fel Essence (Azshara)",count=0,spots={{map=1447,x=0.6596,y=0.1648},{map=1447,x=0.6278,y=0.2549},{map=1447,x=0.6099,y=0.2408}}},{kind="item",id=18622,name="Flawless Fel Essence (Jaedenar)",count=0,spots={{map=1448,x=0.3623,y=0.4587}}},{kind="item",id=18623,name="Flawless Fel Essence (Dark Portal)",count=0,spots={{map=1419,x=0.5773,y=0.5062}}}},text="Impsy in Felwood has asked that you bring him three Flawless Fel Essences originating from three distinct locations.\n\nThe Legashi Satyrs of Azshara hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Jaedenar Legionnaires of Jaedenar hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Felguard Sentries of the Blasted Lands hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region.\n\nRecover the Flawless Fel Essences and return to Impsy in Felwood.",flags=8},[7603]={id=7603,title="Kroshius' Infernal Core",level=55,minLevel=50,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7602},starts={{kind="npc",id=14470,name="Impsy",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4136,y=0.4502}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14469,name="Niby the Almighty",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4138,y=0.4485}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=14467,name="Kroshius",count=0,spots={{map=1448,x=0.457,y=0.3476}}},{kind="item",id=18625,name="Kroshius' Infernal Core",count=0,spots={{map=1448,x=0.457,y=0.3476}}}},text="Search Shatter Scar Vale in Felwood for the remains of Kroshius. When you locate the remains, use the Fel Fire near them and await Kroshius' return. When the infernal has awoken, slay him and take from his corpse Kroshius' Infernal Core.\n\nReturn Kroshius' Infernal Core to Niby the Almighty in Felwood."},[7604]={id=7604,title="A Binding Contract",level=60,minLevel=60,map=242,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,starts={{kind="item",id=18628,name="Thorium Brotherhood Contract"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=12944,name="Lokhtos Darkbargainer"}},objectives={{kind="item",id=17203,name="Sulfuron Ingot",count=0}},text="Turn the Thorium Brotherhood Contract in to Lokhtos Darkbargainer if you would like to receive the plans for Sulfuron.",dungeon="Blackrock Depths"},[7621]={id=7621,title="A Warning",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1423,zone="Eastern Plaguelands",raceMask=0,classMask=16,starts={{kind="npc",id=14494,name="Eris Havenfire",spots={{map=1423,x=0.1721,y=0.1279}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14494,name="Eris Havenfire",spots={{map=1423,x=0.1721,y=0.1279}}}}},[7622]={id=7622,title="The Balance of Light and Shadow",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1423,zone="Eastern Plaguelands",raceMask=0,classMask=16,starts={{kind="npc",id=14494,name="Eris Havenfire",spots={{map=1423,x=0.1721,y=0.1279}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14494,name="Eris Havenfire",spots={{map=1423,x=0.1721,y=0.1279}}}},objectives={{kind="trigger",name="The Balance of Light and Shadow",spots={{map=1423,x=0.1742,y=0.1224}}}},text="Save 50 Peasants before 15 are slain. Speak with Eris Havenfire should you accomplish this task.\n\nYou may view the Death Post to view how many Peasants have been slain.",flags=3},[7623]={id=7623,title="Lord Banehollow",level=58,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,nextQuest=7624,starts={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=9516,name="Lord Banehollow",spots={{map=1448,x=0.3593,y=0.4442}}}},text="Purchase Shadowy Potions from Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.\n\nUse the potions to travel through Jaedenar, and speak with Lord Banehollow."},[7624]={id=7624,title="Ulathek the Traitor",level=58,minLevel=60,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7623},nextQuest=7625,starts={{kind="npc",id=9516,name="Lord Banehollow",spots={{map=1448,x=0.3593,y=0.4442}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=9516,name="Lord Banehollow",spots={{map=1448,x=0.3593,y=0.4442}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18719,name="The Traitor's Heart",count=0,spots={{map=1448,x=0.4076,y=0.4842}}}},text="Confront Ulathek, then bring The Traitor's Heart to Lord Banehollow in Jaedenar."},[7625]={id=7625,title="Xorothian Stardust",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7624},starts={{kind="npc",id=9516,name="Lord Banehollow",spots={{map=1448,x=0.3593,y=0.4442}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18687,name="Xorothian Stardust",count=0}},text="Purchase Xorothian Stardust from Ur'dan. Bring it to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes."},[7626]={id=7626,title="Bell of Dethmoora",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7564},starts={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=9264,name="Elixir of Shadow Power",count=0}},text="Bring 10 Elixirs of Shadow Power to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes."},[7627]={id=7627,title="Wheel of the Black March",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7564},starts={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=14344,name="Large Brilliant Shard",count=0},{kind="item",id=11370,name="Dark Iron Ore",count=0,spots={{map=1428,x=0.6699,y=0.5362},{map=1427,x=0.3214,y=0.2705}}}},text="Bring 6 Large Brilliant Shards and 25 Dark Iron Ore to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes."},[7628]={id=7628,title="Doomsday Candle",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7564},starts={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=15416,name="Black Dragonscale",count=0,spots={{map=1428,x=0.8541,y=0.272},{map=1428,x=0.8837,y=0.3997},{map=1428,x=0.2084,y=0.4504}}}},text="Bring 35 Black Dragonscales to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes."},[7629]={id=7629,title="Imp Delivery",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAny={7625},starts={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=14500,name="J'eevee",count=3}},text="Bring the Imp in a Jar to the alchemy lab in the Scholomance. After the parchment is created, return the jar to Gorzeeki Wildeyes.",dungeon="Scholomance"},[7630]={id=7630,title="Arcanite",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAll={7626,7627,7628},starts={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14437,name="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1244,y=0.3163}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12360,name="Arcanite Bar",count=0}},text="Bring 3 Arcanite Bar to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes."},[7631]={id=7631,title="Dreadsteed of Xoroth",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1428,zone="Burning Steppes",raceMask=0,classMask=256,requiresAll={7629,7630},sourceItems={18663,18629,18670},starts={{kind="npc",id=14436,name="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",spots={{map=1428,x=0.1269,y=0.3164}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14504,name="Dreadsteed Spirit"}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=14502,name="Xorothian Dreadsteed",count=0}},text="Read Mor'zul's Instructions. Summon a Xorothian Dreadsteed, defeat it, then bind its spirit to you.",dungeon="Dire Maul: West"},[7632]={id=7632,title="The Ancient Leaf",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=4,starts={{kind="npc",id=12018,name="Majordomo Executus"},{kind="object",id=179703,name="Cache of the Firelord"},{kind="item",id=18703,name="Ancient Petrified Leaf"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14524,name="Vartrus the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4778,y=0.2408}}}},text="Find the owner of the Ancient Petrified Leaf. Good luck, <Name>; It's a big world.",flags=32},[7633]={id=7633,title="An Introduction",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=4,requiresAny={7632},starts={{kind="npc",id=14524,name="Vartrus the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4778,y=0.2408}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14524,name="Vartrus the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4778,y=0.2408}}}}},[7634]={id=7634,title="Ancient Sinew Wrapped Lamina",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=4,requiresAny={7632},starts={{kind="npc",id=14526,name="Hastat the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.467,y=0.2406}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14526,name="Hastat the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.467,y=0.2406}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18704,name="Mature Blue Dragon Sinew",count=0,spots={{map=1447,x=0.5326,y=0.8043},{map=1452,x=0.6121,y=0.5094},{map=1452,x=0.606,y=0.5357}}}},text="Hastat the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Blue Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Hastat in Felwood.",flags=64},[7635]={id=7635,title="A Proper String",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=4,requiresAny={7632},starts={{kind="npc",id=14525,name="Stoma the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4839,y=0.2229}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14525,name="Stoma the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4839,y=0.2229}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18705,name="Mature Black Dragon Sinew",count=0}},text="Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood."},[7636]={id=7636,title="Stave of the Ancients",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1448,zone="Felwood",raceMask=0,classMask=4,requiresAny={7632},starts={{kind="npc",id=14524,name="Vartrus the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4778,y=0.2408}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14524,name="Vartrus the Ancient",spots={{map=1448,x=0.4778,y=0.2408}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18952,name="Simone's Head",count=0,spots={{map=1449,x=0.3432,y=0.4079}}},{kind="item",id=18953,name="Klinfran's Head",count=0,spots={{map=1428,x=0.2482,y=0.6593}}},{kind="item",id=18954,name="Solenor's Head",count=0,spots={{map=1451,x=0.2472,y=0.7602}}},{kind="item",id=18955,name="Artorius's Head",count=0,spots={{map=1452,x=0.6031,y=0.1318}}}},text="You must find and destroy these four demonic corrupters:\n\nSimone the Seductress.\n\nKlinfran the Crazed.\n\nSolenor the Slayer.\n\nArtorius the Doombringer.\n\nDestroy these creatures and return to Vartrus the Ancient in Felwood with their heads.\n\nRefer to the Petrified Bark in your inventory for clues as to their whereabouts.\n\nYou MUST complete this task by yourself."},[7637]={id=7637,title="Emphasis on Sacrifice",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7638},nextQuest=7639,starts={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=11406,name="High Priest Rohan",spots={{map=1455,x=0.2473,y=0.0816}}}},text="Travel to Ironforge and get High Priest Rohan's Exorcism Censer. You will need to make a donation of 150 gold in order to secure it.",flags=256},[7638]={id=7638,title="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",starts={{kind="npc",id=6171,name="Duthorian Rall",spots={{map=1453,x=0.5048,y=0.4749}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},text="Speak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District."},[7639]={id=7639,title="To Show Due Judgment",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1455,zone="Ironforge",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7637},nextQuest=7640,starts={{kind="npc",id=11406,name="High Priest Rohan",spots={{map=1455,x=0.2473,y=0.0816}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},text="Return the Exorcism Censer to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind."},[7640]={id=7640,title="Exorcising Terrordale",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7639},starts={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=14564,name="Terrordale Spirit",count=0,spots={{map=1423,x=0.1091,y=0.2264}}}},text="Use the Exorcism Censer to drive out the spirits that torment Terrordale. When you have slain 25 Terrordale Spirits, return to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind."},[7641]={id=7641,title="The Work of Grimand Elmore",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7638,7640},nextQuest=7642,starts={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=1416,name="Grimand Elmore",spots={{map=1453,x=0.5973,y=0.3378}}}},text="Speak with Grimand Elmore in Stormwind's Dwarven District."},[7642]={id=7642,title="Collection of Goods",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7641},starts={{kind="npc",id=1416,name="Grimand Elmore",spots={{map=1453,x=0.5973,y=0.3378}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=1416,name="Grimand Elmore",spots={{map=1453,x=0.5973,y=0.3378}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13180,name="Stratholme Holy Water",count=0},{kind="item",id=8836,name="Arthas' Tears",count=0,spots={{map=1422,x=0.4846,y=0.8012},{map=1423,x=0.2528,y=0.6769},{map=1448,x=0.3744,y=0.6126},{map=1448,x=0.4552,y=0.3756}}},{kind="item",id=14047,name="Runecloth",count=0},{kind="item",id=12360,name="Arcanite Bar",count=0}},text="Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water vials, and 150 gold to Grimand Elmore in the Dwarven District of Stormwind.",flags=256},[7643]={id=7643,title="Ancient Equine Spirit",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7642},nextQuest=7644,starts={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14566,name="Ancient Equine Spirit"}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18775,name="Manna-Enriched Horse Feed",count=0}},text="Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse. Merideth Carlson in Southshore apparently is the source for such food.\n\nTravel to the Dire Maul dungeon in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood. Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit. Feed it the special horse feed, thereby soothing the spirit. Finally, give it the Arcanite Barding so it may bless it.",dungeon="Dire Maul: West"},[7644]={id=7644,title="Blessed Arcanite Barding",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7643},nextQuest=7646,starts={{kind="npc",id=14566,name="Ancient Equine Spirit"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},text="Return with the Blessed Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind."},[7645]={id=7645,title="Manna-Enriched Horse Feed",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1424,zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",parentQuest=7643,starts={{kind="npc",id=2357,name="Merideth Carlson",spots={{map=1424,x=0.5219,y=0.5548}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=2357,name="Merideth Carlson",spots={{map=1424,x=0.5219,y=0.5548}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=13724,name="Enriched Manna Biscuit",count=0}},text="Retrieve 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits - the key ingredient in making Manna-Enriched Horse Feed - for Merideth Carlson at Southshore in the Hillsbrad Foothills. The Argent Dawn is known as the sole purveyor of the biscuits.\n\nYou also need to give her 50 gold to soothe her ruffled sensibilities.",flags=256},[7646]={id=7646,title="The Divination Scryer",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7644},nextQuest=7647,starts={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12800,name="Azerothian Diamond",count=0,spots={{map=1447,x=0.5671,y=0.7976},{map=1419,x=0.5488,y=0.5567},{map=1422,x=0.5958,y=0.5077},{map=1428,x=0.6699,y=0.5362}}},{kind="item",id=18335,name="Pristine Black Diamond",count=0,spots={{map=1422,x=0.4512,y=0.6875},{map=1422,x=0.4758,y=0.693},{map=1422,x=0.4499,y=0.1571}}}},text="Bring an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind."},[7647]={id=7647,title="Judgment and Redemption",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7646},sourceItems={18749},starts={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14568,name="Darkreaver's Fallen Charger"}},objectives={{kind="item",id=18799,name="Charger's Redeemed Soul",count=0},{kind="item",id=18792,name="Blessed Arcanite Barding",count=0}},text="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver. Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger.\n\nGive the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger.",dungeon="Scholomance"},[7648]={id=7648,title="Grimand's Finest Work",level=60,minLevel=60,map=1453,zone="Stormwind City",raceMask=5,classMask=2,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={7642},starts={{kind="npc",id=1416,name="Grimand Elmore",spots={{map=1453,x=0.5973,y=0.3378}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=928,name="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",spots={{map=1453,x=0.4843,y=0.5022}}}},text="Take the Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District for his inspection."},[7649]={id=7649,title="Enchanted Thorium Platemail: Volume I",level=60,minLevel=60,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiredSkill={164,300},starts={{kind="item",id=18769,name="Enchanted Thorium Platemail"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14368,name="Lorekeeper Lydros"}},text="Return the book to its rightful owners."},[7650]={id=7650,title="Enchanted Thorium Platemail: Volume II",level=60,minLevel=60,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiredSkill={164,300},starts={{kind="item",id=18770,name="Enchanted Thorium Platemail"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14368,name="Lorekeeper Lydros"}},text="Return the book to its rightful owners."},[7651]={id=7651,title="Enchanted Thorium Platemail: Volume III",level=60,minLevel=55,zone="Other",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiredSkill={164,300},starts={{kind="item",id=18771,name="Enchanted Thorium Platemail"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14368,name="Lorekeeper Lydros"}},text="Return the book to its rightful owners."},[7652]={id=7652,title="A Blue Light Bargain",level=60,minLevel=50,map=1446,zone="Tanaris",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiredSkill={164,265},starts={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}}},[7653]={id=7653,title="Imperial Plate Belt",level=60,minLevel=50,map=1446,zone="Tanaris",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={7652},requiredSkill={164,265},starts={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12359,name="Thorium Bar",count=0}}},[7654]={id=7654,title="Imperial Plate Boots",level=60,minLevel=50,map=1446,zone="Tanaris",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={7652},requiredSkill={164,265},starts={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12359,name="Thorium Bar",count=0}}},[7655]={id=7655,title="Imperial Plate Bracer",level=60,minLevel=50,map=1446,zone="Tanaris",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={7652},requiredSkill={164,265},starts={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12359,name="Thorium Bar",count=0}}},[7656]={id=7656,title="Imperial Plate Chest",level=60,minLevel=50,map=1446,zone="Tanaris",raceMask=0,classMask=0,requiresAny={7652},requiredSkill={164,265},starts={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14567,name="Derotain Mudsipper",spots={{map=1446,x=0.5138,y=0.2867}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=12359,name="Thorium Bar",count=0}}},[7657]={id=7657,