ask is complete.\n\nMarkhor mentioned that the wolves hide in the wilds of the Hinterlands.",flags=8},[7829]={id=7829,title="Hunt the Savages",level=48,minLevel=44,map=1425,zone="The Hinterlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=14741,name="Huntsman Markhor",spots={{map=1425,x=0.7916,y=0.7953}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14741,name="Huntsman Markhor",spots={{map=1425,x=0.7916,y=0.7953}}}},objectives={{kind="npc",id=2929,name="Savage Owlbeast",count=0,spots={{map=1425,x=0.514,y=0.456}}}},text="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete.\n\nMarkhor mentioned that the Savage Owlbeasts occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.",flags=8},[7830]={id=7830,title="Avenging the Fallen",level=48,minLevel=44,map=1425,zone="The Hinterlands",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=14741,name="Huntsman Markhor",spots={{map=1425,x=0.7916,y=0.7953}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14741,name="Huntsman Markhor",spots={{map=1425,x=0.7916,y=0.7953}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=19025,name="Skylord Plume",count=0,spots={{map=1425,x=0.478,y=0.436}}}},text="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill a Razorbeak Skylord and retrieve its Skylord Plume. Return to him once the task is complete.\n\nMarkhor mentioned that the Razorbeak Skylord are a rare breed that tend to occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.",flags=8},[7831]={id=7831,title="A Donation of Mageweave",level=60,minLevel=40,map=1454,zone="Orgrimmar",raceMask=8589934770,classMask=0,faction="Horde",starts={{kind="npc",id=14726,name="Rashona Straglash",spots={{map=1454,x=0.636,y=0.5123}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=14726,name="Rashona Straglash",spots={{map=1454,x=0.636,y=0.5123}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=4338,name="Mageweave Cloth",count=0,spots={{map=1424,x=0.4516,y=0.2829},{map=1434,x=0.439,y=0.1834},{map=1416,x=0.6354,y=0.453},{map=1417,x=0.6844,y=0.8038}}}