ine."},[98027]={id=98027,title="Gleaming Crescent Necklace",level=26,minLevel=22,map=1440,zone="Ashenvale",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",starts={{kind="object",id=669176,name="Gleaming Crescent Pendant",spots={{map=1440,x=0.6299,y=0.7156}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3961,name="Maliynn",spots={{map=1440,x=0.3662,y=0.4998}}}},text="Deliver the Crescent Necklace to Maliynn in Astranaar."},[98028]={id=98028,title="Baron Marinous",level=21,minLevel=17,map=1439,zone="Darkshore",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",starts={{kind="item",id=279275,name="Clouded Water Globe"}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3616,name="Onu",spots={{map=1439,x=0.4355,y=0.7629}}}},text="Bring the Clouded Water Globe to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore."},[98042]={id=98042,title="It's All Fun and Games Until...",level=17,minLevel=12,map=1439,zone="Darkshore",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={949},starts={{kind="object",id=12666,name="Twilight Tome",spots={{map=1439,x=0.3854,y=0.8605}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=3649,name="Thundris Windweaver",spots={{map=1439,x=0.374,y=0.4013}}}},objectives={{kind="item",id=279279,name="Peerless Eye",count=0,spots={{map=1439,x=0.3821,y=0.8721},{map=1439,x=0.3808,y=0.8686}}}},text="Obtain a Peerless Eye from a Twilight Disciple or Thug at the Master's Glaive in Darkshore and find someone in Auberdine who is willing to take it."},[98046]={id=98046,title="Crown of the Earth",level=11,minLevel=1,map=1438,zone="Teldrassil",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alliance",requiresAny={935},nextQuest=98065,starts={{kind="npc",id=3516,name="Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm",spots={{map=1457,x=0.3481,y=0.0926}}}},ends={{kind="npc",id=4092,name="Lariia",spots={{map=1457,x=0.4035,y=0.8868}}}},text="Bring the Drained Vessel to Lariia in the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus."},[98059]={id=98059,title="Hillsbrad's Hoard",level=27,minLevel=23,map=1424,zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",raceMask=4294967373,classMask=0,faction="Alli